cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use samurai in your work, please cite it with the metadata below.
type: software
title: samurai
abstract: >-
  samurai (Structured Adaptive mesh and MUlti-Resolution based on Algebra of
  Intervals) is a header-only C++ library for numerical simulation on adaptive
  Cartesian meshes. It stores the mesh as intervals and implements AMR and
  multiresolution methods with a set algebra on these intervals.
